{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32864","headline":"苑中题友人林亭 · 李频","name":"苑中题友人林亭","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"井邑藏嵓穴，幽栖趣若何。\n春篁抽笋密，夏鸟杂雏多。\n坐有清风至，林无暑气过。\n乱书还就叶，真饮不听歌。\n片影明红藓，斜阴映绿萝。\n雄文终可惜，莫更弃高科。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李频","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_32864.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32864","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}